        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a2429d84-2b78-42c4-a88d-82b8984ca92d).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou have been assigned five High Value Targets (HVTs) at Chongqing, China. Below are the list of targets as well as the preferred methods for eliminating them;\r\rEliminate Angus Pritchard by electrocuting him. \rEliminate Chen Ting with a thrown kitchen knife. \rEliminate Sister Lei by electrocuting her. \rEliminate Mogwai with a fall. \rEliminate Xiao Ming with a remote explosive. \r\rBe a silent assassin, we are so close to the end now. Failure is not an option at all. \r\rBest of luck!\rReapingZ",
